the intended transitive-closure ("diamond") semantics from the P1 review
nit. merchants_test.go:359 (TestGroupKeys_SpacedAsteriskCurrentBehavior)
asserts only the narrow 2-key case (no merge) and its comment block
explicitly documents — without asserting — that adding a bare "SQ *"
(2-token, non-degenerate) third key DOES bridge two otherwise-unrelated
Square merchants, framing it as "a real gap, not a resolved case" for P5.
This matches the ruling's requirement to document, not silently bless, the
gap.

